ol_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01EbFaXD8omYurM1bC4Z5Twb", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49216, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01LR37X6b1czS8dvkXpKuWiL", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49516, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01LR37X6b1czS8dvkXpKuWiL", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49516, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01LR37X6b1czS8dvkXpKuWiL", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 51558, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions, and it is healthy again.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was failing, so I rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that has been healthy in production. The first attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving us-east on v2.3.0 and the other two regions on v2.3.1. I checked the state, then re-issued the rollback, which completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Current status:** v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy, error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV2 for checkout-api. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure, and the post-rollback status. The create request timed out, so I checked the incident list before finishing. It existed once, so there is no duplicate.\n- **Approval:** Change-manager approval wasn't needed, because v2.3.0 has been healthy in production.\n\nFollow-up: someone should look into why v2.3.1 failed and why the orchestrator halted partway through the rollback before anyone re-releases.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_